## Predictions (written before the run)
- feature entries wave in play on their own gate/timer: arm natural: at least one arrival with feature_idx >= 0 in a year on RIVER3; feature entries debited
- feature entries spawn only at embark (or map load): no feature-ref arrival in any arm; the embark units age out and are never replaced
- feature waves share the surface gate: arm surface_held (surface units kept held): no feature arrival; arm natural: feature arrivals only in gaps between surface groups

